      "digest": "06267b29d4bf620f",
      "alt": "A 3D scene graph over the ITC building second floor. A single building node at the top connects down to a room node, then to a dense band of place nodes following the corridor loop, then to object nodes scattered along the walls, and finally to the reconstructed mesh of the floor.",
